  "description": "<h3 data-start=\"730\" data-end=\"799\">🔋 Stanley Fatmax V20 18V 4A Dual Port Charger | NIEUW | €69,99</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"1140\">Altijd volle accu’s met deze <strong data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"873\">Stanley Fatmax V20 4A Dual Port Charger</strong>!<br data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"877\">Deze krachtige <strong data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"911\">dubbele oplader</strong> is geschikt voor <strong data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"979\">alle Stanley Fatmax V20 18V Lithium-Ion accu’s</strong> en maakt het mogelijk om <strong data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1041\">twee accu’s tegelijk op te laden</strong>.<br data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1045\">Perfect voor intensief gebruik of professionals die continu door willen werken zonder pauzes.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1222\">De oplader is <strong data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1173\">nieuw in doos</strong>, volledig getest en direct klaar voor gebruik.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1246\"><strong data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1244\">✅ Specificaties:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1522\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1275\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1275\">Merk: <strong data-start=\"1255\" data-end=\"1273\">Stanley Fatmax</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1311\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1311\">Type: <strong data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1309\">V20 Dual Port Charger</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1333\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1333\">Spanning: <strong data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1331\">18V</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1356\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1336\" data-end=\"1356\">Laadstroom: <strong data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1354\">4A</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1357\" data-end=\"1400\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1400\">Functie: <strong data-start=\"1368\" data-end=\"1398\">Laadt 2 accu’s tegelijk op</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1455\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1403\" data-end=\"1455\">Compatibel met: <strong data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1453\">Alle Stanley Fatmax V20 accu’s</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1502\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1502\">Staat: <strong data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1500\">Nieuw – in originele verpakking</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1522\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1522\">Prijs: <strong data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1522\">€69,99</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1524\" data-end=\"1756\"><strong data-start=\"1524\" data-end=\"1574\">💥 Waarom kopen bij Used Products Spijkenisse?</strong><br data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1577\">✔️ Nieuw & getest<br data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1597\">✔️ Inclusief garantie<br data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1621\">✔️ Direct meenemen of laten verzenden<br data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1661\">✔️ Ook inruil van gereedschap mogelijk<br data-start=\"1699\" data-end=\"1702\">✔️ Groot assortiment Stanley, DeWalt, Makita & Bosch</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1758\" data-end=\"1929\">📍 <strong data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"1790\">Used Products Spijkenisse</strong><br data-start=\"1790\" data-end=\"1793\">Nieuwstraat 16, Spijkenisse<br data-start=\"1820\" data-end=\"1823\">📞 <strong data-start=\"1826\" data-end=\"1841\">06-26008400</strong> – ook bereikbaar via <strong data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1876\">WhatsApp!</strong><br data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1879\">🌐 Bezoek onze webshop of kom langs in de winkel</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1931\" data-end=\"1992\">👉 <strong data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"1992\">Used Products Spijkenisse – Slim kopen, slim verkopen!</strong></p>",
